      "logicalPortrait": "logical/portraits/bodybuilder-01-portrait.png",
      "appearance": "Retain light weathered tan skin, short ash-brown cropped hair, masculine broad brow. Face partly OBSCURED by a dark cybernetic ONI LOWER-FACE MASK covering mouth/chin ONLY, nose/eyes/forehead exposed. Two short lower-jaw metal fangs and angular cheek attachments like the Colossus reference but only below the nose. Both arms are mostly CYBERNETIC from below deltoids: bulky dark mechanical biceps/forearms/hands, exposed neck collar implant and two loose thick cable loops at elbow. Small remaining organic deltoid caps. Worn baggy nearly-black tank with stretched armholes and frayed hem, baggy DARK MUTED BURGUNDY/RED sweatpants, worn charcoal trainers. Anatomical right hand (screen-left) hangs down and firmly GRIPS THE HANDLE OF ONE IRON KETTLEBELL beside thigh. Show its closed loop handle and round bell silhouette with space from leg. Other arm relaxed with hand near hip. Heavy calm stance, gritty basement gym veteran.",
