      "logicalPortrait": "logical/portraits/bodybuilder-02-portrait.png",
      "appearance": "Retain medium-brown skin and short dark CURLY hair. Opaque cybernetic GOGGLES cover BOTH EYES completely: dark wide rectangular lens unit wrapping temples, dim desaturated blue small strip, no visible eyes. Nose/mouth exposed with a weathered cocky smirk and square jaw. Neck largely mechanical, both forearms/hands mechanical, BOTH LEGS FULLY CYBERNETIC from knees to feet with heavy joints and pistons, not human calves. A few thick loose dark wires loop behind knees and at wrists, no spaghetti. Worn oversized charcoal HOODIE with hood DOWN, sleeves pushed up to elbows, frayed cuffs; roomy black knee-length SHORTS expose unmistakably mechanical shins/feet. One lowered hand (screen-left) holds a brown leather WEIGHT/DIP BELT by one end, with a heavy SILVER CHAIN hanging visibly below it around knee height, separated from body. Other hand on hip. Low-key cocky basement gym veteran, normal human height.",
