      "logicalPortrait": "logical/portraits/bodybuilder-03-portrait.png",
      "appearance": "Retain DEEP BROWN skin and bald/shaved head. One VERTICAL HALF OF FACE covered in a cybernetic theater COMEDY/TRAGEDY HALF-MASK: a straight vertical edge dividing forehead to chin along the centerline; only the near-camera half has sculpted worn dull ivory/gunmetal mask with a downturned theatrical eye and dramatic cheek/mouth curve. Other half remains organic. NOT a lower-face mask, NOT whole-face mask. Forehead and eye on masked side hidden, exposed half with hard weathered eye and stern smirk. Dark mechanical neck, both FOREARMS AND HANDS fully cybernetic and some exposed elbow hardware; two thick loose cables join arm to torso. Baggy worn DARK NAVY tracksuit/sweatsuit with zip jacket partly open at neck and sleeves pushed up to elbows; slouchy matching navy sweatpants. CLEAN WHITE running shoes with restrained cool shadows. White chalk-stained hand wraps around BOTH mechanical fists/knuckles and wrists, metal fingertips visible. Arms loosely folded in front of waist so wrapped hands are clear; square shoulders and massive neck, masculine lifelong gym bro, normal height.",
